# package-lock.json was ignored here until 2026-08-18, with no reason recorded.
# The consequence: `npm ci` fails outright, every build resolves dependency
# versions afresh, and the artifact published to Cloudflare Pages is verifiable
# by CONTENT but not by PROVENANCE -- two builds of the same commit can differ
# and nothing says which one is live. Committed deliberately; this is an app,
# not a library.
